## Highlights of the Tour

 - Access stunning interior spaces that throw you back to the Roaring '20s in Chicago;
 - Learn about the culture of the time -- flappers, jazz, Prohibition, Route 66, and more;
 - See the popular Art Deco style through the eyes of the people for whom it was brand new and a symbol of a promising future;
 - Touch the gleaming materials and intricate details that you can only see up close and inside!
